# Artifact Status

This artifact is prepared for CODES 2026 artifact evaluation.

The repository contains the core STE code used by the paper, benchmark input
data, generated HLS kernels, and documentation for reviewing the artifact.

## Badge-Independent Scope

The artifact supports inspection and execution of the proposed Self-Timed
Execution (STE) models for the five benchmarks:

- ResNet8
- ResNet20
- MobileNetV2
- YOLOv5nu
- YOLOv10n

It also includes HLS kernel variants whose FIFO sizes were generated by the
proposed method and by comparison techniques.

## Reproducibility Boundary

The artifact focuses on the core contribution of the paper: the STE models used
to compute FIFO sizes. It does not include the full FIFOAdvisor or LightningSim
flows.

Consequently, the artifact is intended to support reproducing the proposed
method's FIFO-size results from Table II. It does not fully regenerate:

- FIFOAdvisor exploration times from Table II
- Table I latency and II measurements, which require C/RTL cosimulation or deployment
- Table III LightningSim occupancy comparisons

Those results depend on additional third-party tools, long-running HLS flows, or
instrumented simulation environments outside the submitted artifact.
